Compatibility code
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The classes under org.lwjgl in src/main/java implement the part of the LWJGL 2 public API the game
uses, on top of LWJGL 3, and are written for Stein, except:

- org/lwjgl/util/vector/Matrix4f.java and Vector3f.java: their matrix and vector arithmetic is taken
  from LWJGL 2. Copyright (c) 2002-2008 LWJGL Project. All rights reserved. BSD 3-clause licence;
  full text in licenses/LWJGL2-LICENSE.txt.
- org/lwjgl/util/glu/GLU.java: the 4x4 matrix inversion (invert) is adapted from gluInvertMatrix of
  the Mesa 3D GLU library (SGI Free Software License B, equivalent to the X11/MIT licence).
